# Disband (Shift+D) in three places. Fixture: Dragoon (id 136) is selected in the colony tile Quebec (45,24);
# Caravel A (id 84) at sea (48,24) carries two passengers; Colonist (id 125, Tobacconist) stands in the
# field at (43,25) in a stack of three (no orders, 1 move). The Colonist before the Dragoon in the pool
# (id 135) is sentried, so it is not in the rotation when the Dragoon goes (port_bugs.md #1168).
key d shift
click 160 108              # @SUREDISBAND "Really disband Dragoons?": No, the Dragoon stays
shot
key d shift
click 160 96               # Yes: the Dragoon is gone, the next unit in the pool after it (id 144) is selected
shot
click 168 112              # tile (48,24): "Units Present" stack picker
shot
click 190 78               # pick Caravel A (id 84)
shot
key d shift
key Return                 # @DISBANDSHIP "cannot disband a ship at sea while it is carrying units": OK, ship stays
shot
click 40 128               # tile (43,25): "Units Present" stack picker
shot
click 190 78               # pick the Tobacconist colonist (id 125)
shot
key d shift
click 160 108              # No: the colonist stays
shot
key d shift
click 160 96               # Yes: the colonist is gone
shot
wait 5
